# TODO - Workspace and package metadata

## Objective

Complete the bootstrap without introducing extra workspace manifests.

## Acceptance

- Keep one root workspace with inherited dependencies, metadata and lints.
- Keep stable and nightly channels floating; retain Cargo.lock.
- Complete package metadata and confirm the engine is publishable.
- Run Linux x86-64 compilation without errors.

## Evidence

Validated locally on Linux x86-64 with `cargo validate --no-cache`.
The single workspace retains Cargo.lock and floating stable/nightly channels.
The engine and tool manifests inherit workspace metadata and lint settings;
tools are non-publishable and have role-specific descriptions.

The validator packages and verifies the engine offline. The local archive
contains only its manifests, lockfile, source, README and Apache-2.0 licence.
The licence is checked against the canonical root text. No publication or
Git operations were performed. The engine remains a bootstrap library.
